# Trivy CVE ignore list for backend Docker image
#
# Each line is a CVE ID. Only add CVEs here with documented justification.

# minimatch@9.0.5 ReDoS via repeated wildcards (O(4^N) with N consecutive *)
# No fix available in 9.x line; fixed only in 10.2.1+ which is a breaking
# major version bump incompatible with glob@10.5.0's ^9.0.4 requirement.
# Risk: LOW — minimatch is used server-side by google-auth-library/rimraf
# for file path matching, never with untrusted user-supplied glob patterns.
# Also ignored in pnpm auditConfig (root package.json).
CVE-2026-26996
